        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pawn Stars Australia, Pawn Stars UK, Pawn Stars South Africa, Pawn Stars\n- Organizations: A&E, History channel\n- Topics: television adaptations, international spin-offs\n\nFacts:\n- Pawn Stars UK is a British reality television series that debuted on 26 August 2013 on the British version of the History channel.\n- Pawn Stars Australia is the Australian adaptation of the American series Pawn Stars.\n- Pawn Stars Australia premiered on 21 July 2015 on A&E.\n- Pawn Stars Australia was the third international spin-off of Pawn Stars, after Pawn Stars UK and Pawn Stars South Africa.",
